---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="License — Limitcode Pro"
  description="Limitcode Pro licensing terms."
  canonicalPath="/license/"
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="license-page">
    <section class="container license-wrap">
      <h1>License</h1>

      <h2>Limitcode Pro licensing terms</h2>

      <h3>Limitcode Pro package</h3>
      <p>
        Limitcode Pro is a native AI coding agent plugin built for Sublime Text 4.
        Limitcode Pro is proprietary software, copyrighted by Jawuil (Jawuil Labs).
      </p>

      <p>
        <em>
          (Note: The separate open-source edition of Limitcode is governed by its own open-source
          license in its respective GitHub repository).
        </em>
      </p>

      <hr />

      <h2>Summary (TL;DR)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>One-time purchase, perpetual use:</strong>
          Your license grants you permanent use of Limitcode Pro. It includes <strong>1 full year of
          free updates</strong> from the date of purchase. After one year, you can continue using the latest
          version released within your update window indefinitely, with no recurring subscription required.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>3 devices per user:</strong>
          One license allows a single person to activate and use Limitcode Pro on up to <strong>3 computers</strong>
          (Windows, macOS, or Linux) used exclusively by that person, for both personal and commercial/work projects.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Offline grace period:</strong>
          License verification requires a periodic internet check, with up to <strong>30 days of offline grace</strong>
          between checks.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Privacy &amp; BYOK:</strong>
          Limitcode Pro connects directly from your machine to your chosen AI providers or local models. Your source code,
          prompts, and API keys are never routed through or stored on Limitcode servers.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <hr />

      <h2>Limitcode Pro License</h2>

      <p><strong>Copyright (c) 2026 Jawuil (limitcode.jawuil.dev)</strong></p>

      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>Grant of License:</strong> Purchasing a license on Gumroad or directly from the author grants a single
          individual non-exclusive, non-transferable permission to install and use Limitcode Pro on up to three (3)
          computers operating under that person's direct use, including for commercial software development.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Updates &amp; Perpetual Access:</strong> Each license includes one (1) year of software updates starting
          from the purchase date. Once the one-year update period expires, the licensee retains the perpetual right to use
          the last version of the software released prior to the expiration date.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Restrictions:</strong> Limitcode Pro may not be sub-licensed, resold, shared, or redistributed. You may
          not publish or share your license key, bypass or modify the license verification mechanism, or loan, rent,
          transfer, or grant any rights to Limitcode Pro—or any derivative work containing Limitcode Pro—to any other
          person or organization without the prior written consent of the author.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Intellectual Property:</strong> Limitcode Pro is copyrighted by Jawuil. No title or intellectual property
          rights in the Limitcode Pro software are transferred to you. The author retains all rights not expressly granted
          by this license. You retain full ownership and responsibility for any code, files, or outputs generated or
          modified within your projects using the software.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Disclaimer of Warranty &amp; Liability:</strong>
          THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO
          THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE
          AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES (INCLUDING, WITHOUT LIMITATION, LOSS OF DATA,
          SOURCE CODE MODIFICATIONS, SHELL COMMAND EXECUTION, OR THIRD-PARTY API CHARGES) OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN
          AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR
          OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .license-page {
    padding: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px) 0 clamp(64px, 8vw, 120px);
  }

  .license-wrap {
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .license-wrap h1 {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .license-wrap h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.4vw, 2.3rem);
    margin: 28px 0 14px;
  }

  .license-wrap h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.7vw, 1.45rem);
    margin: 18px 0 10px;
  }

  .license-wrap p,
  .license-wrap li {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .license-wrap p {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .license-wrap ul,
  .license-wrap ol {
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .license-wrap ul {
    list-style: disc;
  }

  .license-wrap ol {
    list-style: decimal;
  }

  .license-wrap li {
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .license-wrap hr {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    margin: 28px 0;
  }
</style>
